 </span><span begin="00:27.780" end="00:28.290">feeling </span><span begin="00:28.290" end="00:28.830">still </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.160">deep </span><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.730">down </span><span begin="00:29.730" end="00:29.880">is </span><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:31.440">good</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.750" end="00:37.440"><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.080">If </span><span begin="00:34.080" end="00:34.290">I </span><span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.500">could </span><span begin="00:34.500" end="00:34.800">see </span><span begin="00:34.800" end="00:35.070">through </span><span begin="00:35.070" end="00:35.670">walls</span><span begin="00:35.670" end="00:35.670">, </span><span begin="00:35.670" end="00:35.850">I </span><span begin="00:35.850" end="00:36.030">could </span><span begin="00:36.030" end="00:36.390">see </span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:36.570">you're </span><span begin="00:36.570" end="00:37.440">faking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.890" end="00:41.280"><span begin="00:37.890" end="00:38.130">If </span><span begin="00:38.130" end="00:38.370">you </span><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:38.580">could </span><span begin="00:38.580" end="00:38.910">see </span><span begin="00:38.910" end="00:39.090">my </span><span begin="00:39.090" end="00:39.780">thoughts </span><span begin="00:39.780" end="00:39.960">you </span><span begin="00:39.960" end="00:40.140">would </span><span begin="00:40.140" end="00:40.470">see </span><span begin="00:40.470" end="00:40.650">your </span><span begin="00:40.650" end="00:41.280">faces</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.400" end="00:46.020"><span begin="00:41.400" end="00:41.910">Safe </span><span begin="00:41.910" end="00:42.060">in </span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.300">my </span><span begin="00:42.300" end="00:43.320">rental </span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:43.680">like </span><span begin="00:43.680" end="00:43.890">an </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:44.280">armored </span><span begin="00:44.280" end="00:44.790">truck </span><span begin="00:44.790" end="00:45.300">back </span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:46.020">then</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.320" end="00:48.810"><span begin="00:46.320" end="00:46.710">We </span><span begin="00:46.710" end="00:46.920">didn't </span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:47.490">give </span><span begin="00:47.490" end="00:47.850">a </span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:47.850">*</span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:47.850">*</span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:47.850">*</span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:47.850">* </span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:48.420">back </span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.810">then</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.810" end="00:51.780"><span begin="00:48.810" end="00:49.050">I </span><span begin="00:49.050" end="00:49.290">ain't </span><span begin="00:49.290" end="00:49.380">a </span><span begin="00:49.380" end="00:49.980">kid </span><span begin="00:49.980" end="00:50.340">no </span><span begin="00:50.340" end="00:51.780">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.260" end="00:56.220"><span begin="00:52.260" end="00:52.530">We'll </span><span begin="00:52.530" end="00:53.100">never </span><span begin="00:53.100" end="00:53.400">be </span><span begin="00:53.400" end="00:53.640">those </span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:54.180">kids </span><span begin="00:54.180" end="00:56.220">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.850" end="01:02.040"><span begin="00:56.850" end="00:57.180">We'd </span><span begin="00:57.180" end="00:57.480">drive </span><span begin="00:57.480" end="00:57.600">to </span><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:58.650">Syd's</span><span begin="00:58.650" end="00:58.680">, </span><span begin="00:58.680" end="00:59.040">had </span><span begin="00:59.040" end="00:59.250">the </span><span begin="00:59.250" end="01:00.270">X6 </span><span begin="01:00.270" end="01:00.780">back </span><s